    "message": "Update gcloud skill operations syntax, MCP guidance, and WIF auth link\n\n- Use service-scoped `gcloud <GROUP> operations describe` instead of nonexistent top-level `gcloud operations describe`.\n- Include folder and organization queries alongside billing in MCP `--billing-project` guidance and update WIF auth link to `sdk/docs/authenticate`.\n\nPiperOrigin-RevId: 1020240786",
